00:03:59.610 --> 00:04:02.290
SHARAT SHROFF: Yeah, so what do
you think we're going to use?

00:04:02.290 --> 00:04:03.850
ERIK MCCLENNEY:
Well, a good option

00:04:03.850 --> 00:04:05.580
