and it has the correct number,

00:13:04.830 --> 00:13:07.970
but it's telling us
that we have a default.

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:10.940
Maybe we have a batch
size for our query of 20.

00:13:10.940 --> 00:13:14.410
And I know that 20 is
the default batch size.

00:13:14.410 --> 00:13:17.810
And this is probably why we have
so many of these next calls.

