00:37:24.060 --> 00:37:27.320
you see that lol is lowercase.

00:37:27.320 --> 00:37:28.720
Now this is terrible code.

00:37:28.720 --> 00:37:29.600
It's not robust.

00:37:29.600 --> 00:37:31.750
We should never do
anything like this ever.

00:37:31.750 --> 00:37:34.340
But we did, and we
suffered the consequences.

00:37:34.340 --> 00:37:36.340
But Debugger helped
us find the problem.

00:37:36.340 --> 00:37:37.631
SHARAT SHROFF: So that's right.

00:37:37.631 --> 00:37:44.570
I mean, the way
Stackdriver Debugger

00:37:44.570 --> 00:37:49.850
works, it just completely
revolutionizes, in my opinion,

00:37:49.850 --> 00:37:52.830
how you would debug
code in production.

00:37:52.830 --> 00:37:55.420
You can capture
application state,

00:37:55.420 --> 00:37:58.920
study your behavior of
your code, and all of this

00:37:58.920 --> 00:38:02.990
without ever having to pause,
interrupt your application.

00:38:02.990 --> 00:38:08.448
And all of this data is
available in near real time.

00:38:08.448 --> 00:38:11.073
ERIK MCCLENNEY: We also have the
