00:38:13.930 --> 00:38:15.221
but I can share it with myself.

00:38:15.221 --> 00:38:17.370
So I'll just copy
the link here, and I

00:38:17.370 --> 00:38:21.500
will put this into a new
tab that will run this.

00:38:25.130 --> 00:38:26.950
You can see we've got
the same session run.

00:38:26.950 --> 00:38:30.660
We have our snapshot
there in the same line,

00:38:30.660 --> 00:38:32.160
in the same file.

00:38:32.160 --> 00:38:36.170
And we've got the same
